WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.425
Roxy flew to Wacky Wayne's Used Cars.

2
00:00:03.426 --> 00:00:07.072
Detective Smith was taking notes beside an inflatable tube man.

3
00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.670
The tube man looked like he was dancing.

4
00:00:09.671 --> 00:00:13.608
"Who's your new friend, Detective?" Roxy asked.

5
00:00:13.609 --> 00:00:16.670
"Ha-ha," Detective Smith said.

6
00:00:16.671 --> 00:00:19.420
"This thing is supposed to attract customers.

7
00:00:19.421 --> 00:00:22.393
But all of Wayne's customers just left."

8
00:00:22.394 --> 00:00:25.277
Wacky Wayne hurried over.

9
00:00:25.278 --> 00:00:27.453
He was holding a dusty package.

10
00:00:27.454 --> 00:00:30.320
An ugly steering wheel cover was inside.

11
00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:34.031
"It was the strangest thing!" he said.

12
00:00:34.032 --> 00:00:37.222
"Seven cars flew off my lot!

13
00:00:37.223 --> 00:00:40.512
If you can get my cars back, I'll give you a gift."

14
00:00:40.513 --> 00:00:44.242
Detective Smith looked up from his notebook. "What is it?"

15
00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:50.013
"This lovely wheel cover!" Wayne said.

16
00:00:50.014 --> 00:00:52.791
"Uh, thanks," Roxy said.

17
00:00:52.792 --> 00:00:55.800
"But superheroes don't need rewards."

18
00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:58.124
Detective Smith turned back to Roxy.

19
00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:05.472
"The police are looking for the car carrier. No luck so far."

20
00:01:05.473 --> 00:01:09.809
"Do any of your cars have GPS trackers?" Roxy asked.

21
00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.955
"Some do," Wayne said.

22
00:01:11.956 --> 00:01:15.331
"But we don't enable them until someone buys the car."

23
00:01:15.332 --> 00:01:18.442
His eyes lit up. "I just remembered something.

24
00:01:18.443 --> 00:01:20.966
My own car has a working tracker."

25
00:01:20.967 --> 00:01:23.195
Wayne showed them his smartphone.

26
00:01:23.196 --> 00:01:26.335
Roxy saw a map with a glowing red dot.

27
00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:29.282
"Okay, Rocket Girl," Detective Smith said. "We

28
00:01:29.283 --> 00:01:33.667
should . . . Rocket Girl?" ***

29
00:01:33.668 --> 00:01:35.698
Roxy arrived at a junkyard.

30
00:01:35.699 --> 00:01:38.948
A carrier loaded with cars was parked inside.

31
00:01:38.949 --> 00:01:41.434
"That's strange," Roxy thought.

32
00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:44.840
"Those cars are used, but they don't look too bad.

33
00:01:44.841 --> 00:01:48.028
Why did the thief bring them to a junkyard?"

34
00:01:48.029 --> 00:01:51.579
Crunch! Roxy heard a loud noise.

35
00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:54.917
She flew over a tall crane and stacks of junk.

36
00:01:54.918 --> 00:01:58.098
A teenage girl stood with her back to Roxy.

37
00:01:58.099 --> 00:02:02.613
As the girl waved her hands, two cars rose in the air.

38
00:02:02.614 --> 00:02:04.198
The girl clapped.

39
00:02:04.199 --> 00:02:07.187
Crunch! The cars smashed together.

40
00:02:07.188 --> 00:02:13.680
The girl laughed. "This is fun!"

41
00:02:13.681 --> 00:02:16.991
"How did she do that?" Roxy thought.

42
00:02:16.992 --> 00:02:19.440
Just then the girl saw Roxy.

43
00:02:19.441 --> 00:02:23.290
"You finally arrived, Rocket Girl."

44
00:02:23.291 --> 00:02:26.054
"Who are you?" Roxy asked.

45
00:02:26.055 --> 00:02:29.751
"I'm Magda Magnets."

46
00:02:29.752 --> 00:02:32.041
Several cars rose.

47
00:02:32.042 --> 00:02:35.996
They moved around in the air as Magda waved her hands.

48
00:02:35.997 --> 00:02:38.125
"Why did you steal those cars?"

49
00:02:38.126 --> 00:02:40.521
Roxy asked as some moved toward her.

50
00:02:40.522 --> 00:02:43.643
Magda shrugged. "It was fun."

51
00:02:43.644 --> 00:02:46.409
Some of the cars were now behind Roxy.

52
00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:50.957
Magda smiled. "You know what's even more fun?"

53
00:02:50.958 --> 00:02:53.933
Roxy shook her head. "Nope."

54
00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:58.294
"Battling a superhero!" Magda clapped.

55
00:02:58.295 --> 00:03:05.922
Whoosh! Used cars shot toward Roxy from all sides!

